You have an Azure subscription containing a group named Group1 and an Azure SQL Managed Instance hosting a database named DB1.  

You must ensure that Group1 has read access to new tables created in DB1, using the principle of least privilege.  

How should you complete the Transact-SQL statement?

<Dropdown
